    "type": "Figure",
    "diagnosis": "Giant cell tumour of bone",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "<p>Section of a giant cell tumour showing nuclear atypia of the mutant mononuclear cells, consisting of smudgy chromatin and intranuclear pseudoinclusion. The implications of these focal changes are unknown.</p>",
