    "type": "Figure",
    "diagnosis": "Giant cell tumour of bone",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "<p>Typical features of a giant cell tumour in the distal radius showing homogeneous pale soft tumour with focal recent haemorrhage and cyst formation.</p>",
