    "diagnosis": "<p>Giant cell tumour of bone</p>",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "<p>Giant cell tumour of bone before denosumab treatment. Lytic, trabeculated tumour in the distal radius showing mild expansile remodelling and marked cortical thinning.</p>",
